    {
      "id": "SFPL",
      "code_hash": "2c1a298867b80e9ad91433a6848ad31e",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"ms-and-msbar-at-the-same-scale\">MS and MSbar at the same scale</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Use <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\Delta=1/\\epsilon+c_\\Delta||)</marimo-tex> with\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(c_\\Delta=\\log(4\\pi)-\\gamma_E||)</marimo-tex> and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(D=4-2\\epsilon||)</marimo-tex>.\n<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1007.4716\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OneLOop</a> divides its master integrals by\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(r_\\Gamma=\\Gamma(1-\\epsilon)^2\\Gamma(1+\\epsilon)/\\Gamma(1-2\\epsilon)||)</marimo-tex>.\nThe conventional loop measure restores <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||((4\\pi)^\\epsilon r_\\Gamma=\n1+c_\\Delta\\epsilon+O(\\epsilon^2)||)</marimo-tex>, with <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(i/(16\\pi^2)||)</marimo-tex> stripped off.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">If a normalized loop coefficient is <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(P/\\epsilon+F||)</marimo-tex>, this measure gives\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(P/\\epsilon+F+c_\\Delta P||)</marimo-tex>. MS subtracts its pole; MSbar also subtracts\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(c_\\Delta P||)</marimo-tex>. The actual generated CT amplitudes cancel the corresponding\nterms in every sector. The finite scheme shift left in MS is checked too.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The reference extracts UV terms after tensor reduction. Shared UV expansion\nprovides those same local coefficients here; no full finite vertex is needed\nfor this comparison. The direct selective-IRR calculation below derives the original reference's\nnonzero auxiliary gluon mass separately. Its physical pole constants agree.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-0' random-id='6ba4b5c4-e734-b50c-7758-96ac7ff7bc12'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Zq&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-xi*CF/eps&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-(eps*xi*CF*cDelta+xi*CF)/eps&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Zm&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-3*CF/eps&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-3*(eps*CF*cDelta+CF)/eps&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;ZA&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-1/6*(3*xi*CA+4*Nf-13*CA)/eps&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-1/6*(3*eps*xi*CA*cDelta+4*eps*Nf*cDelta-13*eps*CA*cDelta+3*xi*CA+4*Nf-13*CA)/eps&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Z\u03be&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-1/6*(3*xi*CA+4*Nf-13*CA)/eps&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-1/6*(3*eps*xi*CA*cDelta+4*eps*Nf*cDelta-13*eps*CA*cDelta+3*xi*CA+4*Nf-13*CA)/eps&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Zc&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-1/4*(xi*CA-3*CA)/eps&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;-1/4*(eps*xi*CA*cDelta-3*eps*CA*cDelta+xi*CA-3*CA)/eps&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Zg&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;1/6*(2*Nf-11*CA)/eps&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;1/6*(2*eps*Nf*cDelta-11*eps*CA*cDelta+2*Nf-11*CA)/eps&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;ZAm&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Constant&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Zcm&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MS&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;MSbar&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0&#92;&quot;}]&quot;' data-total-rows='8' data-total-columns='3' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='true' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element></div>"
          }
        }
